     className=\"text-3xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-primary md:text-4xl\"\n                    dir=\"ltr\"\n                  >\n                    {item.value}\n                  </dd>\n                  <dt className=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\">\n                    {item.label}\n                  </dt>\n                </dl>\n              </li>\n            ))}\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  )\n}\n",
